      "_comment": "The candidate-data path — CVs, contact details, interview transcripts. These globs are the hops the map traces: the analyze intake and its upload bounds, the subprocess bridge that carries the file to Python, the two egress seals (TS fetch guard + the Python half the fetch guard cannot see), the stores the data comes to rest in, and the self-service surfaces a candidate reads it back through. Several of them are also owned by a feature doc (candidates, compliance, llm-provider-layer) and that is deliberate: a change to how a CV reaches a model provider should name BOTH the feature doc and this map. A hop this list misses is a hop the map will drift on.",
